'''Experiments''' are minigames that grant Enchanting XP and Enchanting-related rewards. Experiments are performed on the [[Experimentation Table]].

== Mechanism ==
A player must first obtain an {{Item|Experimentation Table}} and place it on their {{zone|Private Island}}. {{keypress|Right-Clicking}} on it opens the Experiments interface.

The {{Item|Experimentation Table}} has three charges, with every Main Experiment costing one charge. One charge gets renewed after {{Green|24}} hours and players can purchase additional games up to 3 times, each being more expensive than the last.
