The table features two Add-On Experiments and the Main Experiment. The Main Experiment can be done once the player completes both Add-On Experiments.

== Add-On Experiments ==
'''Add-Ons Experiments''' have to be played before the '''Main Experiment''' and allow the player to gain extra {{pink|clicks}}, as well as some bonus {{Skill|Enchanting|XP}}. 
* Add-Ons are memory related mini-games, best compared to a simple sequence memory test and the "Chimpanzee Test".
* Upon finishing an Add-On the player can either accept the rewards or decline them to try again for a better score. Subsequent add-on attempts will however cost {{Experience}}.

=== Add-On Experiment: Chronomatron ===
[[File:Chronomatron Completion Rewards.png|alt=Chronomatron Completion Rewards image|thumb|Chronomatron Completion Rewards]] A visual and auditory memory game in which the player must memorize a chain of color-coded "notes" and recite them. 
* When the player successfully recites the chain, the same chain is played with an additional note added onto the end. 
* The game ends when the player misses a note or completes {{green|49}} note chains, although the player is rewarded for completing at most {{green|15}} note chains. There are various tiers of this experiment:
