== RNG Meter ==
Players can select any item that can be obtained from the {{Item|Experimentation Table}} in their [[RNG Meter|{{pink|RNG Meter}}]]. Every {{Skill XP|1000 [[Enchanting]]}} obtained from {{Pink|Superpairs}} grants {{pink|1 RNG Meter XP}}.
