== Tips ==
* [[File:Experimentation Table.png|21px|link=]] Experiments are currently the best way to level up {{Skill|Enchanting}}.
* An {{Item|Guardian Pet|rarity=Epic}} grants up to {{Stat|Enchanting Wisdom|30}}

== Trivia ==
* The player used to be able to receive the +3 click bonus on every difficulty, not just Metaphysical. This bug was patched in 0.19.4.
* The maximum experience reward is given after passing {{Green|15}} chain of notes on Chronomatron or {{Green|20}} numbers on Ultrasequencer.
** This means that even if the player passes more than {{Green|15}} notes on the Chronomatron, they will receive only a maximum of 90,000 XP at most (on Metaphysical difficulty) and similar with 140,000 XP for the Ultrasequencer.
* It used to be possible to use an insta-find power-up on another power up, which would not trigger the effect, this was later patched now correctly giving 2 instafinds afterwards .
* Bits spent on renewing experiments used to not give the player [[Fame Ranks|Fame]]. This was later patched {{InfoNeeded}}.
* If the server the player is on reboots while the player is playing Chronomatron or Ultrasequencer, they will lose their progress. Players can restart, but the addons will be treated as if the player had never started it. Players are advised to wait for a bit If the servers are rebooting for an update.
* There are several mods that make Chronomatron and Ultrasequencer easier such as [[mod:skyblocker-liap|Skyblocker]] and [[mod:skyhanni|SkyHanni]]. Note that enabling more than one of these modules at once may cause issues such as double-clicking which would fail the addons.
* The Ultrasequencer will always have each number follow a specific set of colors, allowing it to be solved more easily without the need of mods. The pattern of colors goes from white, {{aqua|light blue}}, {{blue|blue}}, {{purple|purple}}, {{pink|magenta}}, {{pink|pink}}, {{red|red}}, {{gold|orange}}, {{Yellow|yellow}}, {{Green|lime green}}, {{Dark Green|green}}, and {{Dark Aqua|cyan}}. Once the player finishes 12 rounds, the color pattern will repeat for the next 12 and so on until the entire board is solved.
* It used to be possible to get more than one pair of [[Titanic Experience Bottle]]s while playing Superpairs, with no visual indication of which items belong to which pair. This forced players to rely on luck when trying to pair these bottles. This was however later patched {{InfoNeeded}}
* It is possible to obtain multiple tiers of the same enchantment in the same Superpairs, for example {{Ench|Protection VI}} and {{Ench|Protection VII}}.
* Completing the board on Ultrasequencer will only count as a sequence of 35, meaning it is impossible to obtain a sequence of 36.
* A bug causes one less round to be required for maximum Chronomatron rewards.
* The restart costs for add-ons are not permanent. On server restarts this penalty is automatically removed.

